{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受词条偏密，部分情绪描述重复，快速扫读不如X的左右分栏直接省力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让观众能迅速找到叙事和音乐感受，扫读负担较轻，但右侧词群容易变成并列的信息堆积，缺少明确的先后和重点。Y通过关键词高亮、叙事与感受交替，以及感受词与具体乐段同步出现，让观众更容易理解人物为什么反复动摇，也更能感受到从怀念、孤独、挣扎到不再逼自己选边的完整心理变化。尤其在音乐感受的细腻程度和前后呼应上，Y明显更有层次，虽然需要付出更多阅读注意力，但整体获得的信息和情感体验更丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "25753086-469c-46bf-bd87-b95d5dd5cde5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154737302521Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:48:23.514464+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "42072446ddaa5a5189259ea3d42476e87ecfaff5ecb8a4c8be6a959130ac1613", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt